041600     MOVE  36                     TO LANG-MSGNUM.
041700     PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT.
041800     MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER          TO RCVR-ERR-AREA.
041900     MOVE  55                     TO LANG-SETNUM.
042000     MOVE  1                      TO LANG-MSGNUM.
042100     PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT.
042200     MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER          TO PO-HEADING.
042300     MOVE  55                     TO LANG-SETNUM.
042400     MOVE  6                      TO LANG-MSGNUM.
